WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.002
Harry: From calorie
count to portion sizes,

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.403
we wanted to find out all the differences

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:05.839
between Cinnabon in the US and the UK.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.140
This is "Food Wars."

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.412
In the UK, Cinnabon's classic rolls come

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:14.748
in four portion sizes: as a single,

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:17.617
as a two-pack, as a four-pack,

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:19.753
and our largest size,

00:00:19.753 --> 00:00:20.820
a six-pack.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.256
In the US, Cinnabon classic rolls

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:26.226
come in three sizes: the single —

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:27.560
oh, my God.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.396
I want to eat this so bad.

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:31.097
Then you got the four-pack,

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:34.067
for you and, let's be honest, just you,

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:36.870
and then you can get yourself a six-pack.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.438
This has some weight to it.

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:43.176
Cinnabon in the US also
offers catering sizes

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:45.111
that you can't get in the UK.

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:48.348
That means we can also get
our classic Cinnabon rolls

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:51.117
in a nine-pack catering tray.

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:53.820
Put that on the screen! Oh!

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:57.991
That's 50% larger than
the UK's biggest pack.

00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:00.960
Oh, amazing.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.062
But is there a difference in the size

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:03.229
of the rolls themselves?

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:04.364
We're going to weigh a classic Cinnabon

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:05.598
in both countries to find out.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:12.205
You can get BonBites in
the UK, but unfortunately

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:14.074
the store I went to didn't
have them this morning.

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:15.542
If you can get them, then they should come

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:16.476
in a pack of four.

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:18.478
In the US, you can get BonBites

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:21.881
in a pack of four, 16,

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:24.184
or the catering tray of 36.

00:01:24.184 --> 00:01:28.888
This is nine times bigger
than the UK's four-pack.

00:01:28.888 --> 00:01:30.723
[thunder rumbles]
[laughs maniacally]

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:32.425
Four? Get a life.

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:34.394
UK Cinnabons also offer MiniBons.

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:36.162
These come in three portion sizes:

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:38.465
as a single, as a six-pack,

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:43.136
or our largest size, as a 15-pack.

00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:47.640
Use these as, like, a doorstop.
I think they're stale.

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:48.575
[box thuds]

00:01:48.575 --> 00:01:50.844
Over here, our MiniBons come in portions

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:55.582
of one, nine, 15,

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:59.219
and, of course, we have
a catering tray of 20.

00:01:59.219 --> 00:02:00.053
What about the drinks?

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:02.622
In the UK, we can get
hot drinks in two sizes:

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:04.891
as a regular, which is 12 fluid ounces,

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:07.327
or a large, which is 16 fluid ounces.

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:09.963
In the US, our hot beverages
come in four sizes:

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:12.665
small, regular, large,

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:15.268
and this big catering bag.

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:16.469
Or does it?

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:18.271
[whooshes]

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:20.406
Because they forgot those three.

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:22.542
The more observant among
you would've noticed

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:25.378
that the UK's large is
only the regular over here.

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:26.779
We can also get iced drinks in the UK,

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:28.081
but they just come in the same sizes

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:30.350
as our hot drinks, 12 and 16 ounces.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.218
The sizes change a little when you choose

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:33.486
the iced drinks in the US.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.955
We got the small and the regular

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:37.123
and the catering size.

00:02:37.123 --> 00:02:39.359
Again, the more observant
of you would notice

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:41.761
that there are some beverages
missing from this cup.

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:43.496
"Joe must've started
drinking them earlier."

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:47.233
Nuh-uh. Had a major
beverage-spilling mishap

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:48.535
with the delivery here.

00:02:48.535 --> 00:02:50.036
Ah, more on that later.

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:52.472
The final things to compare
are the toppings and sauces.

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:54.107
In the UK, you can get
some additional toppings,

00:02:54.107 --> 00:02:55.475
like the cream cheese and the pecans,

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:58.811
and they just come in the
one size, these little cups.

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:01.014
In the US, we can get extra frosting

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:03.716
as a regular side of the
cream-cheese frosting,

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:08.221
I mean, a whole pint of the frosting,

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:09.889
a side of pecans, who cares?

00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:11.391
Let's weigh the largest frosting side

00:03:11.391 --> 00:03:12.825
in each country to find the difference.

00:03:14.494 --> 00:03:17.263
[laughs] That just, like, barely moved.

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:19.999
So this is eight of their frostings.

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:22.001
Soon to be seven.

00:03:22.001 --> 00:03:25.071
It's described as "cream cheese ambient."

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:29.676
Cream cheese ambient.
That sounds like a really

00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:31.678
experimental music genre.

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:34.214
It's pretty cool, you probably
wouldn't have heard of it,

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:36.149
but yeah, no, I listen to
mostly cream cheese ambient.

00:03:38.718 --> 00:03:40.453
Here are all the Cinnabon
items from the UK

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:42.121
that you won't find in the US.

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:43.723
Here's everything on a Cinnabon menu

00:03:43.723 --> 00:03:46.593
you will not find in the UK.

00:03:46.593 --> 00:03:48.194
To start off with, we
have some Bon varieties

00:03:48.194 --> 00:03:49.829
you actually won't find in the US.

00:03:49.829 --> 00:03:52.165
Let's start down here with ChocoBons.

00:03:52.165 --> 00:03:53.733
So, as far as I can tell, ChocoBons are

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:55.201
pretty much just the standard rolls,

00:03:55.201 --> 00:03:56.736
maybe with a little
bit of chocolate powder

00:03:56.736 --> 00:03:58.504
sprinkled into the mix, but then also

00:03:58.504 --> 00:04:00.740
they are covered in chocolate sauce.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:01.574
Cheers.

00:04:05.612 --> 00:04:08.815
Our next exclusive roll
is a Lotus Biscoff Bon.

00:04:08.815 --> 00:04:10.950
Longtime viewers of
the show will know that

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:13.386
I don't really like Lotus Biscoff.

00:04:13.386 --> 00:04:15.021
I didn't realize how
passionately the crew felt

00:04:15.021 --> 00:04:17.790
about Lotus Biscoff, because
I'm now taking heat for this.

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:19.425
Apparently it's because
I don't like coffee

00:04:19.425 --> 00:04:20.793
and they're really good with coffee.

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:22.795
I just drink tea, so
maybe it's wasted on me.

00:04:22.795 --> 00:04:25.198
Again, look, you do you, it's fine,

00:04:25.198 --> 00:04:26.899
just not for me. Too sweet for me.

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:28.501
And then finally, because
we're actually shooting this

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:30.470
on Valentine's Day, we can get

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:33.306
a limited-edition Valentine's Bon.

00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:38.011
All of our exclusive Bons
can also be purchased

00:04:38.011 --> 00:04:40.246
in all three forms, which
is the regular size,

00:04:40.246 --> 00:04:41.948
the BonBites, and the MiniBons.

00:04:41.948 --> 00:04:44.751
We actually don't have any
exclusive Bons in the US.

00:04:44.751 --> 00:04:48.054
We can only get the classic
and caramel pecan Bons,

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:50.823
both of which are obviously
available in the UK.

00:04:50.823 --> 00:04:53.926
But we do have some other
exclusives to showcase.

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:56.496
The first one, the churro swirls.

00:04:56.496 --> 00:05:01.301
♪ They forgot them ♪

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:04.470
But here's what they look like,

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.005
and I would love to have tried them.

00:05:06.005 --> 00:05:07.040
Now, we don't have churro swirls,

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.675
but we do have something
called Cinnachips,

00:05:08.675 --> 00:05:11.244
which are like small, crunchy
pieces of cinnamon roll.

00:05:11.244 --> 00:05:14.480
I'm not sure if crunchy is what I want

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.316
from my cinnamon roll.

00:05:16.316 --> 00:05:19.352
[crunching]

00:05:19.352 --> 00:05:21.187
They are crunchy. They weren't kidding.

00:05:21.187 --> 00:05:22.722
These aren't doing it for me.

00:05:22.722 --> 00:05:26.526
They're really kind of dry and
a little bit burned, almost,

00:05:26.526 --> 00:05:29.996
so you kind of get that,
like, acrid burn taste,

00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:32.165
which cancels out pretty much any benefits

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:33.599
that you get from the cinnamon sugar.

00:05:33.599 --> 00:05:34.567
[crunches loudly]

00:05:34.567 --> 00:05:37.203
We also have something
called Center of the Roll,

00:05:37.203 --> 00:05:39.472
which Cinnabon has trademarked in the US.

00:05:39.472 --> 00:05:41.040
Now, here's what I'm assuming this is

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:42.208
by looking at it.

00:05:42.208 --> 00:05:45.945
What it looks like,
they just took Cinnabons

00:05:45.945 --> 00:05:50.750
and, like, mashed them up
or, like, unraveled them

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:53.152
and put them in a cup, and this is smart,

00:05:53.152 --> 00:05:55.588
'cause the only thing I
think keeping everyone

00:05:55.588 --> 00:05:57.390
from getting a Cinnabon at the mall

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.225
is it's kind of a pain in the butt to eat,

00:05:59.225 --> 00:06:01.527
and I think Cinnabon noticed this,

00:06:01.527 --> 00:06:02.895
and they responded with this.

00:06:02.895 --> 00:06:05.098
Like, "You're right. We'll just rip it up,

00:06:05.098 --> 00:06:07.367
put it in a cup, and have at it."

00:06:12.071 --> 00:06:13.506
This works.

00:06:13.506 --> 00:06:15.842
Well, you don't want to
mess with the classics.

00:06:15.842 --> 00:06:17.810
If you want to

00:06:18.711 --> 00:06:20.747
sit down, have a Cinnabon
at the food court,

00:06:20.747 --> 00:06:22.014
go for it, but

00:06:23.483 --> 00:06:24.917
if you're not in the mood,
just get one of these.

00:06:24.917 --> 00:06:26.519
Oh, yeah.

00:06:26.519 --> 00:06:28.020
Oh, my God, look at this.

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:29.422
Are kidding me with this?

00:06:29.422 --> 00:06:30.456
This is so great.

00:06:33.826 --> 00:06:35.027
Oh, yeah.

00:06:36.229 --> 00:06:37.964
Oh, I forgot —

00:06:37.964 --> 00:06:40.032
oh, I forgot I'm shooting
a video right now.

00:06:40.032 --> 00:06:41.934
This is the, that was the regular,

00:06:41.934 --> 00:06:44.103
and this is the caramel pecan Bon.

00:06:44.103 --> 00:06:45.238
We have a near equivalent here,

00:06:45.238 --> 00:06:46.773
but we call it Roll-on-the-Go.

00:06:46.773 --> 00:06:48.641
As far as I can tell, it's
pretty much just the same thing.

00:06:48.641 --> 00:06:50.209
It's a small cup of I think

00:06:50.209 --> 00:06:52.078
just the center pieces of cinnamon rolls.

00:06:52.078 --> 00:06:54.914
Ours come in two flavors,
classic or choco.

00:06:54.914 --> 00:06:56.916
I do think my favorite
part of a cinnamon roll

00:06:56.916 --> 00:06:58.785
is the gooey middle bit.

00:06:58.785 --> 00:06:59.852
See if this holds up.

00:07:01.654 --> 00:07:03.289
This is pretty good.

00:07:03.289 --> 00:07:04.857
Decent amount of frosting.

00:07:04.857 --> 00:07:06.426
They could maybe have given
you slightly more frosting,

00:07:06.426 --> 00:07:09.629
'cause I think there's some
drier bites in the middle. But.

00:07:12.665 --> 00:07:13.566
Pretty good.

00:07:13.566 --> 00:07:16.135
In the US, we also have cookie BonBites.

00:07:17.236 --> 00:07:18.371
These are chocolate chip cookies

00:07:18.371 --> 00:07:19.839
with cinnamon rolls inside of —

00:07:19.839 --> 00:07:21.707
I'm just finding this out right now.

00:07:21.707 --> 00:07:24.043
Chocolate chip cookies with
cinnamon rolls inside of them?

00:07:24.043 --> 00:07:25.812
Yo, straight up when I saw this, I'm like,

00:07:25.812 --> 00:07:27.980
who's getting cookies at Cinnabon?

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:30.516
This cannot have a cinnamon roll inside.

00:07:30.516 --> 00:07:32.251
Oh, my God, do you see it?

00:07:32.251 --> 00:07:34.120
It actually — what?

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.855
I didn't even know this existed!

00:07:35.855 --> 00:07:37.857
You got that? You got that, yeah?

00:07:38.724 --> 00:07:42.128
Yo, look at that, oh.
Look what's inside of it.

00:07:42.128 --> 00:07:43.930
Oh, my God, that's crazy.

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:46.699
This cookie's pregnant with a Cinnabon.

00:07:46.699 --> 00:07:48.501
[baby cries]
Now let's get in here.

00:07:50.169 --> 00:07:52.138
Eh, better an idea than execution.

00:07:53.239 --> 00:07:55.541
We also have CinnaSweeties,

00:07:55.541 --> 00:08:00.046
which look like mini
doughnuts that I'm assuming

00:08:00.046 --> 00:08:01.180
are cinnamon — oh, wait,

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:02.515
I think these have the frosting inside.

00:08:02.515 --> 00:08:04.484
We've done these for ... Taco Bell?

00:08:04.484 --> 00:08:06.719
The Cinnabon Delights. I'm pretty sure

00:08:06.719 --> 00:08:08.721
this is filled with some sort
of, like, cream cheese, right?

00:08:08.721 --> 00:08:10.857
Wait a second!

00:08:10.857 --> 00:08:11.858
There's no --

00:08:14.594 --> 00:08:15.428
[gasping]

00:08:15.428 --> 00:08:17.497
There's no cream cheese
in these! They're blanks!

00:08:17.497 --> 00:08:19.332
The UK Cinnabon website also advertises

00:08:19.332 --> 00:08:20.666
that some of their branches will have

00:08:20.666 --> 00:08:22.301
Carvel brand ice cream as an option,

00:08:22.301 --> 00:08:23.536
but unfortunately, we didn't have that

00:08:23.536 --> 00:08:24.604
at the one we went to.

00:08:24.604 --> 00:08:27.306
Now we're on to the sauces and toppings.

00:08:27.306 --> 00:08:30.743
In the US, we have a side of Oreo pieces

00:08:30.743 --> 00:08:33.913
that you can get on top
of your Bon. There it is.

00:08:33.913 --> 00:08:37.550
We also have the 8 ounces of frosting,

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:39.952
and we also have — grr, close.

00:08:40.786 --> 00:08:41.888
This right here is,

00:08:41.888 --> 00:08:44.724
you get a side of the caramel frosting.

00:08:48.494 --> 00:08:49.629
That's also really good.

00:08:49.629 --> 00:08:51.297
We only have the one
exclusive topping option here

00:08:51.297 --> 00:08:54.800
in the UK, and it's this
one, the Lotus Biscoff crumb.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:57.570
In the interest of fairness,
I'm going to try it again.

00:09:02.875 --> 00:09:05.978
It's just fine. It's just fine.

00:09:05.978 --> 00:09:07.647
Maybe with a coffee, but.

00:09:10.716 --> 00:09:13.286
No, it's still not for me. Sorry, guys.

00:09:13.286 --> 00:09:14.954
Next up, we got drinks.

00:09:14.954 --> 00:09:16.622
Ah, finally. I'm dying of thirst.

00:09:16.622 --> 00:09:17.757
We have coffee, obviously,

00:09:17.757 --> 00:09:19.892
and you can also get
yourself a hot chocolate.

00:09:19.892 --> 00:09:21.460
Let's check out their hot chocolate.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:22.662
I mean, it looks like hot chocolate.

00:09:22.662 --> 00:09:23.796
There's nothing to see.

00:09:25.798 --> 00:09:27.166
Wow, actually not that good.

00:09:27.166 --> 00:09:29.001
Blech.

00:09:29.001 --> 00:09:30.369
Skip that.

00:09:30.369 --> 00:09:32.305
We actually have a better
range of hot drinks in the UK,

00:09:32.305 --> 00:09:34.507
including pretty much a full
range of espresso drinks,

00:09:34.507 --> 00:09:36.609
including an Americano, a cappuccino,

00:09:36.609 --> 00:09:38.244
a latte, a mocha, and so on.

00:09:38.244 --> 00:09:40.079
We can also get a tea and a hot chocolate.

00:09:40.079 --> 00:09:41.380
You can also customize the hot drinks

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.616
with a range of syrups,
including cinnamon spice,

00:09:43.616 --> 00:09:46.052
toasted marshmallow,
salted caramel, and more,

00:09:46.052 --> 00:09:47.687
although if you put any
of those in a cup of tea,

00:09:47.687 --> 00:09:49.021
I will fight you. [boxing bell rings]

00:09:49.021 --> 00:09:51.958
In the US, we have way more
cold drink options than hot.

00:09:51.958 --> 00:09:54.594
Here are the following
exclusive cold drink options.

00:09:54.594 --> 00:09:59.365
First up, cinnamon roll
cold brew iced coffee.

00:10:00.466 --> 00:10:02.868
Another victim of the Uber driver.

00:10:02.868 --> 00:10:04.737
Ooh! [laughs]

00:10:05.671 --> 00:10:07.406
I'm falling apart.

00:10:07.406 --> 00:10:09.442
Pretty good. Too sweet.

00:10:09.442 --> 00:10:11.277
Then we got the raspberry lemonade.

00:10:11.277 --> 00:10:14.747
Also missing 2 inches. Ubefied.

00:10:15.681 --> 00:10:18.017
I mean, I don't want to
give the guy a bad rating,

00:10:18.017 --> 00:10:21.120
but, like, look, I have
not sipped any of these.

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:27.059
Oh, my God, this raspberry,
I love it. It's great.

00:10:27.059 --> 00:10:30.630
Shout-out to Greta Thunberg.
I'm gonna use my straw twice.

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:32.098
I care about the environment!

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.601
No more single-use plastic.

00:10:35.601 --> 00:10:38.237
This is the frozen raspberry lemonade.

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:41.874
Whoa!

00:10:41.874 --> 00:10:43.743
That's, like, powerful.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:45.845
This is really good.

00:10:45.845 --> 00:10:47.880
Bottle of milk.

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:49.115
No, thanks.

00:10:49.115 --> 00:10:51.717
And, of course, fountain drinks,

00:10:51.717 --> 00:10:53.819
and I'm the most bummed because

00:10:53.819 --> 00:10:56.555
out of all the drinks that spilled —

00:10:56.555 --> 00:10:58.958
we have so many flavors to choose from.

00:10:58.958 --> 00:11:00.960
Let's get those on the screen.

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.828
But the one I specifically
wanted was this one,

00:11:02.828 --> 00:11:04.830
was the Pibb Xtra.

00:11:07.233 --> 00:11:11.137
Pibb Xtra's perfectly fine.
It's a Dr Pepper wannabe.

00:11:11.137 --> 00:11:14.373
Back in the '90s, '97, '98, or whatever,

00:11:14.373 --> 00:11:16.676
Mr. Pibb changed its formula to Pibb Xtra.

00:11:16.676 --> 00:11:19.512
They're trying to get in on
Dr Pepper's market share.

00:11:19.512 --> 00:11:21.781
It's so annoying. But the problem is,

00:11:21.781 --> 00:11:24.550
is that there's no Mr. Pibb
anymore. [rousing music]

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:28.888
30 years of no Mr. Pibb. It's ridiculous!

00:11:28.888 --> 00:11:31.857
I am using my platform right now

00:11:31.857 --> 00:11:35.361
to talk to the executives
at Pibb Xtra or Mr. Pibb:

00:11:35.361 --> 00:11:38.698
Release the Mr. Pibb recipe.

00:11:38.698 --> 00:11:40.032
I'm begging you.

00:11:40.032 --> 00:11:41.233
It doesn't have any value for you!

00:11:41.233 --> 00:11:42.835
You're not making it, so
there's no value, right?

00:11:42.835 --> 00:11:43.969
You're just sitting on the recipe,

00:11:43.969 --> 00:11:45.171
you're not even making it?

00:11:45.171 --> 00:11:46.572
It's worthless to you.

00:11:46.572 --> 00:11:48.541
It's priceless to me.

00:11:48.541 --> 00:11:49.775
And I don't want you people watching,

00:11:49.775 --> 00:11:51.744
this happened last time,
people were messaging me like,

00:11:51.744 --> 00:11:54.113
"Oh, yeah, we got Mr.
Pibb here at the Walmart."

00:11:54.113 --> 00:11:56.315
It's like, it's Pibb
Xtra, it's not Mr. Pibb.

00:11:56.315 --> 00:11:58.317
They're different. OK?

00:11:58.317 --> 00:12:03.289
If anyone watching has cans
of Mr. Pibb from the '90s,

00:12:03.289 --> 00:12:05.524
connect with me. I will buy it off of you.

00:12:05.524 --> 00:12:06.892
I will pay for the shipping.

00:12:06.892 --> 00:12:09.762
That stays in the video, or I quit.

00:12:09.762 --> 00:12:11.897
We have a few exclusive cold
drinks over here in the UK,

00:12:11.897 --> 00:12:14.667
including an iced latte,
a strawberry lemonade,

00:12:14.667 --> 00:12:15.768
and a mango lemonade.

00:12:15.768 --> 00:12:18.037
I got the strawberry lemonade today.

00:12:18.037 --> 00:12:19.572
Pretty pleasant. Quite refreshing.

00:12:19.572 --> 00:12:21.540
Also, in the UK, is it true that you guys

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:23.409
consider lemonade to be more like

00:12:23.409 --> 00:12:26.212
a carbonated lemon beverage, like Sprite?

00:12:26.212 --> 00:12:28.214
That's true, Joe. If you ask
for a lemonade in the UK,

00:12:28.214 --> 00:12:30.516
expect something that's
carbonated and usually clear,

00:12:30.516 --> 00:12:31.784
so more like a Sprite.

00:12:31.784 --> 00:12:33.486
Although I will say,
Cinnabon seems to be doing it

00:12:33.486 --> 00:12:34.353
kind of the American way,

00:12:34.353 --> 00:12:35.888
so maybe you'd approve of that one.

00:12:35.888 --> 00:12:38.157
Now, you can also get
something called a Chillatta

00:12:38.157 --> 00:12:39.692
in the US and the UK.

00:12:39.692 --> 00:12:42.194
However, over here, they come in flavors

00:12:42.194 --> 00:12:44.897
of Oreo cookies and cream,
strawberries and cream,

00:12:44.897 --> 00:12:47.666
which I got, and the
double chocolate mocha.

00:12:50.669 --> 00:12:52.138
That's just OK.

00:12:53.639 --> 00:12:54.473
Don't bother.

00:12:54.473 --> 00:12:56.408
In the UK, Chillattas
come in five flavors:

00:12:56.408 --> 00:12:58.611
cinnamon roll, strawberry, mango,

00:12:58.611 --> 00:13:00.412
caramel latte, and chocolate mocha.

00:13:00.412 --> 00:13:03.415
I got the cinnamon roll one today.

00:13:03.415 --> 00:13:05.818
Actually looks pretty good.

00:13:05.818 --> 00:13:07.386
It also looked even more impressive

00:13:07.386 --> 00:13:09.755
when the whipped cream was
kind of in a nice swirl.

00:13:10.723 --> 00:13:12.224
It's just, like, a,

00:13:12.224 --> 00:13:14.059
again, quite sweet

00:13:14.059 --> 00:13:18.130
but pretty, like, luxurious
cinnamony milkshake.

00:13:20.299 --> 00:13:21.667
It certainly seems like it.

00:13:21.667 --> 00:13:23.769
I cannot remember a time
when there wasn't one

00:13:23.769 --> 00:13:25.437
in any mall I've gone to.

00:13:25.437 --> 00:13:27.406
You can always smell it before you see it.

00:13:27.406 --> 00:13:31.677
It's impossible to separate
the scent of Cinnabon

00:13:31.677 --> 00:13:34.480
from the mall and vice versa.

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:38.083
It's like a soundtrack to the memory,

00:13:38.083 --> 00:13:39.718
but how it smells,

00:13:39.718 --> 00:13:43.289
so Cinnabon is like the
smell-track to malls.

00:13:43.289 --> 00:13:44.590
Does that make sense?

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:46.325
And that's by design.

00:13:46.325 --> 00:13:48.694
Cinnabon purposely put their locations

00:13:48.694 --> 00:13:51.197
away from food courts
and other food stalls

00:13:51.197 --> 00:13:53.833
so the Cinnabon odor would waft

00:13:53.833 --> 00:13:56.135
and not interfere with any other smells.

00:13:56.135 --> 00:13:58.070
So if you're in the
mall, you smell Cinnabon

00:13:58.070 --> 00:14:03.042
and only Cinnabon, and that's
almost like nose marketing?

00:14:03.042 --> 00:14:05.311
I don't know how you would describe it,

00:14:05.311 --> 00:14:06.512
and it's really smart, right?

00:14:06.512 --> 00:14:08.113
'Cause when you smell
it, man, you smell it,

00:14:08.113 --> 00:14:10.716
and you're like, there it
is, I gotta have one. So.

00:14:10.716 --> 00:14:12.651
Is Cinnabon a meal, a snack, a dessert?

00:14:12.651 --> 00:14:14.753
I'm gonna go with snack.

00:14:14.753 --> 00:14:16.488
I feel like one of
those regular Cinnabons,

00:14:16.488 --> 00:14:18.858
I could just eat one of those
easily. Maybe one and a half.

00:14:18.858 --> 00:14:20.526
I don't really know my Cinnabon limit.

00:14:20.526 --> 00:14:21.961
I just kind of found out
about these little guys,

00:14:21.961 --> 00:14:24.763
and I feel like I could easily
knock out half this tray.

00:14:25.965 --> 00:14:27.700
I don't think it should be a meal,

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.668
'cause that could do
some damage to your body.

00:14:29.668 --> 00:14:33.272
As far as a dessert, it seems weird to me

00:14:33.272 --> 00:14:36.242
to eat a full meal and
then get a Cinnabon.

00:14:36.242 --> 00:14:38.644
Like, it just kind of exists on its own.

00:14:38.644 --> 00:14:42.081
So, yeah, it's weird
to consider it a snack,

00:14:42.081 --> 00:14:44.416
but you're definitely
not having it for lunch,

00:14:44.416 --> 00:14:46.585
and you're definitely not
having it after a meal, so.

00:14:46.585 --> 00:14:48.520
By default, snack.

00:14:51.023 --> 00:14:53.092
In the UK, a single Cinnabon classic roll

00:14:53.092 --> 00:14:55.194
will cost you £2.99,

00:14:55.194 --> 00:14:57.863
which at the time of
recording this was $3.65.

00:14:57.863 --> 00:15:00.900
In the US, a single Cinnabon classic roll

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:03.802
will cost you $7.19.

00:15:03.802 --> 00:15:06.305
That makes this single US roll

00:15:06.305 --> 00:15:09.041
97% more expensive.

00:15:09.041 --> 00:15:10.476
That is hilarious.

00:15:10.476 --> 00:15:12.244
But does the price change if you bulk-buy?

00:15:12.244 --> 00:15:13.946
A six-pack of classic rolls in the UK

00:15:13.946 --> 00:15:15.547
will cost you £10.49,

00:15:15.547 --> 00:15:18.651
which at the time of recording was $12.80.

00:15:18.651 --> 00:15:20.552
So by spending three and a
half times the amount of money,

00:15:20.552 --> 00:15:22.454
you're getting six times
the amount of Cinnabon,

00:15:22.454 --> 00:15:23.455
which is a pretty good deal.

00:15:23.455 --> 00:15:26.558
In the US, a six-pack of
Cinnabon classic rolls

00:15:26.558 --> 00:15:29.461
will cost you $24.99,

00:15:29.461 --> 00:15:31.897
so even when you are bulk-buying,

00:15:31.897 --> 00:15:35.601
it's 95% more expensive to buy in the US.

00:15:35.601 --> 00:15:39.271
For that same 500% increase in food,

00:15:39.271 --> 00:15:42.608
we pay 247% more money.

00:15:42.608 --> 00:15:44.543
It's not often on "Food
Wars" that it's much cheaper

00:15:44.543 --> 00:15:46.812
in the UK than it is in
the US to buy fast food.

00:15:46.812 --> 00:15:47.646
How's that feel, Joe?

00:15:47.646 --> 00:15:51.283
Well, it's Cinnabon, and I
will pay whatever it takes.

00:15:51.283 --> 00:15:52.718
This stuff is amazing.

00:15:52.718 --> 00:15:54.753
They could double the
price. I'm still eating it.

00:15:57.122 --> 00:15:58.724
The UK Cinnabon website doesn't give

00:15:58.724 --> 00:16:00.793
a full nutritional
breakdown including things

00:16:00.793 --> 00:16:02.861
like the fat and the
sugar content of Cinnabon.

00:16:02.861 --> 00:16:05.664
However, when we got this CinnaPack,

00:16:05.664 --> 00:16:06.865
I noticed that they actually have

00:16:06.865 --> 00:16:08.600
a full breakdown on the box.

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:09.935
Here, we're given the information

00:16:09.935 --> 00:16:13.105
for 100 grams' worth of
classic Cinnabon rolls.

00:16:13.105 --> 00:16:14.173
So you might remember from earlier,

00:16:14.173 --> 00:16:15.240
when we weighed one roll,

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:17.609
we found that it was pretty
much exactly 200 grams,

00:16:17.609 --> 00:16:19.611
so doubling those numbers
gives us the stats

00:16:19.611 --> 00:16:21.380
for a full roll in the UK.

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:23.415
Here's everything that's
in a classic Cinnabon roll

00:16:23.415 --> 00:16:24.984
in the UK.

00:16:24.984 --> 00:16:27.853
So that's almost 40% of your
daily recommended calories,

00:16:27.853 --> 00:16:29.655
80% of your daily saturated fat,

00:16:29.655 --> 00:16:32.057
and over 110% of your daily sugar.

00:16:32.057 --> 00:16:33.459
To put the calories into context,

00:16:33.459 --> 00:16:34.994
one of these rolls is like eating

00:16:34.994 --> 00:16:36.662
three McDonald's hamburgers.

00:16:36.662 --> 00:16:39.631
Here's everything in a classic
Cinnabon roll in the US.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.368
You are reading that right,

00:16:42.368 --> 00:16:44.837
61 grams of sugar.

00:16:44.837 --> 00:16:46.138
And for some reason,

00:16:46.138 --> 00:16:49.408
1,150 milligrams of sodium?

00:16:49.408 --> 00:16:52.044
That puts us slightly ahead of the UK

00:16:52.044 --> 00:16:53.746
in every single category.

00:16:53.746 --> 00:16:54.947
I mean, look at that sodium.

00:16:54.947 --> 00:16:58.050
That is way higher, for some reason.

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:02.588
That's exactly 50% of your
daily sodium in one roll.

00:17:02.588 --> 00:17:05.024
What about some other even
more unhealthy menu items?

00:17:05.024 --> 00:17:06.625
The most-calorific roll in the UK

00:17:06.625 --> 00:17:07.860
is the Lotus Biscoff roll,

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:10.662
which clocks in at 1,019 calories.

00:17:10.662 --> 00:17:12.364
That's a hefty increase
on the standard roll

00:17:12.364 --> 00:17:15.034
as well as being over half of
your daily caloric allowance,

00:17:15.034 --> 00:17:16.602
or, as we now use to quantify things,

00:17:16.602 --> 00:17:18.137
four McDonald's hamburgers.

00:17:18.137 --> 00:17:19.738
The least-healthy roll in the US

00:17:19.738 --> 00:17:23.842
is the caramel pecan Bon,
which is 1,090 calories.

00:17:23.842 --> 00:17:25.644
This is also the most calorific thing

00:17:25.644 --> 00:17:28.414
on the entire US menu, sort of.

00:17:28.414 --> 00:17:30.949
A single caramel pecan Bon roll

00:17:30.949 --> 00:17:34.319
is 1,090 calories, but
according to Cinnabon,

00:17:34.319 --> 00:17:36.422
if you get them in a pack of four or six,

00:17:36.422 --> 00:17:38.190
the calories of each individual roll

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:41.193
increases to 1,160.

00:17:41.193 --> 00:17:43.462
It is unclear why that is the case,

00:17:43.462 --> 00:17:45.164
but I'm going to go ahead and guess

00:17:45.164 --> 00:17:48.100
because they dump way more frosting on it.

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:49.768
The most-calorific thing on the UK menu

00:17:49.768 --> 00:17:51.370
actually isn't a roll, it's this,

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:53.639
a 16-ounce cinnamon roll Chillatta.

00:17:53.639 --> 00:17:57.576
One of these contains a
whopping 1,231 calories.

00:17:57.576 --> 00:17:59.978
That means that one of these
large cinnamon roll Chillattas

00:17:59.978 --> 00:18:02.748
combined with one of our
classic cinnamon rolls in the UK

00:18:02.748 --> 00:18:04.216
would put you pretty much exactly

00:18:04.216 --> 00:18:06.452
at your 2,000-calorie daily limit.

00:18:09.188 --> 00:18:12.091
Cinnabon does not disclose
a full ingredients list

00:18:12.091 --> 00:18:14.059
in the US, only allergens.

00:18:14.059 --> 00:18:15.828
The website in the UK also didn't contain

00:18:15.828 --> 00:18:18.330
ingredients information, but once again,

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:20.432
the box provided us with
all of the ingredients

00:18:20.432 --> 00:18:23.635
of a classic cinnamon
roll, and it is a lot.

00:18:23.635 --> 00:18:24.703
But are there any ingredients which

00:18:24.703 --> 00:18:25.771
you need to look out for?

00:18:25.771 --> 00:18:27.272
The bun itself is pretty much fine,

00:18:27.272 --> 00:18:29.174
despite the sheer number of ingredients.

00:18:29.174 --> 00:18:31.610
The things to watch out
for are actually found

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:33.212
in the frosting.

00:18:33.212 --> 00:18:35.380
The frosting contains an
imitation vanilla extract,

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.516
which in turn contains E1520.

00:18:37.516 --> 00:18:39.551
This is also known as propylene glycol.

00:18:39.551 --> 00:18:40.686
It's fairly common in foods

00:18:40.686 --> 00:18:42.654
and in small doses is used as a carrier

00:18:42.654 --> 00:18:44.623
for ingredients which
aren't soluble in water.

00:18:44.623 --> 00:18:46.892
However, it can be toxic in large doses.

00:18:46.892 --> 00:18:48.827
It's one of the main
ingredients in antifreeze,

00:18:48.827 --> 00:18:50.696
as it lowers the freezing point of water.

00:18:50.696 --> 00:18:53.132
Too much propylene glycol could lead

00:18:53.132 --> 00:18:56.201
to internal bleeding and kidney failure.

00:18:56.201 --> 00:18:58.170
Mm. The good news is that you're unlikely

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:00.139
to ever hit these levels from food.

00:19:00.139 --> 00:19:01.707
Just don't go drinking antifreeze.

00:19:01.707 --> 00:19:05.077
The lemon extract in the
frosting also contains E102,

00:19:05.077 --> 00:19:07.412
sometimes known as yellow 5 or tartrazine.

00:19:07.412 --> 00:19:09.481
It's a somewhat controversial
yellow food dye.

00:19:09.481 --> 00:19:11.850
It was part of a panic in
the UK about food colorings

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:13.619
causing hyperactivity in children,

00:19:13.619 --> 00:19:14.653
although eventually it was shown

00:19:14.653 --> 00:19:16.522
that there was limited evidence for this.

00:19:16.522 --> 00:19:19.992
A 2015 study also found that yellow No. 5

00:19:19.992 --> 00:19:23.629
can damage your white
blood cells, which, mm,

00:19:23.629 --> 00:19:26.331
means you're likely to
develop tumors and cancer.

00:19:27.633 --> 00:19:29.368
See us out, dancing rats.

00:19:32.971 --> 00:19:36.241
A US Cinnabon weighs

00:19:36.241 --> 00:19:38.977
222 grams, 2-2-2,

00:19:38.977 --> 00:19:42.781
as in the type of diabetes
this video's going to give me.

00:19:42.781 --> 00:19:44.116
No. 2, baby.

